title: 'Westend: Bulletin moves to system parachain 1010'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Bulletin Westend moves from para 2487 to 1010, the system parachain id it has on Polkadot.
    `BULLETIN_ID` and `BulletinParaId` move to `westend_runtime_constants::system_parachain` and
    are re-exported from `testnet_parachains_constants::westend::locations`. The value of
    `testnet_parachains_constants::westend::locations::BULLETIN_ID` changes from 2487 to 1010.

    Asset Hub Westend's system-chain rules now cover Bulletin, so its Bulletin-only exceptions are
    removed: the WND teleport case `WndFromBulletin` and the barrier entry
    `ValidatorCollatorChainLocations`. Para 2487 is no longer trusted for WND teleports and no
    longer gets explicit unpaid execution.
crates:
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: major
- name: testnet-parachains-constants
  bump: minor
- name: westend-runtime-constants
  bump: minor
